{
  "id": "c8d9ec6305ec626294a79cfe",
  "title": "忍者神龟3",
  "summary": "童年阴影系列，微笑继续。本篇又名：一块披萨引发的回忆。 这是当年包机房里的大热门游戏。名字有点歧义，甚至我20年前写《激龟忍者传》时的认知都是错的：日版是忍者神龟2，美版因为把激龟忍者传也算了进去，所以是忍者神龟3，盗版一般盗的是美版，所以也应该算3。 这次的阴影不少人也能猜到：打不死的斯雷德。当年游戏开发商为了防止盗版，给游戏上了特殊的加密。最有名的就包括一碰就死的《外星战将》，第二关BOSS不死的《特救指令》和本作，第六关BOSS不死的《忍者神龟3》。显然，一碰就死和第二关过不去属于早死早升天的爽快死法，其伤害性远远小于打了一个多小时之后第六关过不去。 故事放到我身上，是加了料的： 话说我大爷1991年秋天的时候再婚，大娘是寡妇带了个儿子。白捡的堂哥属羊头，我属猴屁股，他大我20个月，差不多两岁，高我一届…",
  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/2fbc149d06cdab3c1fb26ad688ef6070d91ab5459152add2566ae2c9ef6a029c187c85797ca657997e4b7f4142382f85bb6be3667f7efa813067e33bd1ddab21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">忍者神龟3：曼哈顿计划</a></p>\n<p>童年阴影系列，微笑继续。本篇又名：一块披萨引发的回忆。<br>\n这是当年包机房里的大热门游戏。名字有点歧义，甚至我20年前写<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/ac04b092661b10d6fd609c148bc056fee6bd0fffb243730836f8875bc368040d8ba66210a002dc7d6dd947e9f779ca166c73b5c6218f9f353cfcff4523f25fb14f4223af0e64\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">《激龟忍者传》</a>时的认知都是错的：日版是忍者神龟2，美版因为把激龟忍者传也算了进去，所以是忍者神龟3，盗版一般盗的是美版，所以也应该算3。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/04e9ed9f6f3c42d1e3a09f57208518c6a0661b3f58710ed05670cea4a70645decd4fca523fd30e7d7ea439548e85fe483628f06d3b42f4374a19faeda833d2580ab1788a22a31c7be90470a42dd6153b25d441a4f40a3b3105021d59012f0d9996a6882e463846b9769c5cd983645a38d9624b25ffc262cc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_000\"></a></p>\n<p>这次的阴影不少人也能猜到：打不死的斯雷德。当年游戏开发商为了防止盗版，给游戏上了特殊的加密。最有名的就包括一碰就死的《外星战将》，第二关BOSS不死的《特救指令》和本作，第六关BOSS不死的《忍者神龟3》。显然，一碰就死和第二关过不去属于早死早升天的爽快死法，其伤害性远远小于打了一个多小时之后第六关过不去。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/1caa386baa4714a8bb5410b637a31fbfa5e6d5956e6caf6201088eba977cd97086f588237731c17d4e0bf34d25afdb80814a67468922f4f5ab7f63eae9eeb1526721fad2659b468f82b2e6be7c2263d00626088928cb8b87333d40682d424a1df7d5d2295ca90beb1edff8b080b85000eedcd9ae92b942d8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_001\"></a></p>\n<p>故事放到我身上，是加了料的：<br>\n话说我大爷1991年秋天的时候再婚，大娘是寡妇带了个儿子。白捡的堂哥属羊头，我属猴屁股，他大我20个月，差不多两岁，高我一届。<br>\n大娘很快发现我妈是奶奶家这边的话事人，就千方百计讨好以达成间接讨好我妈的目的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/9dd108b8edfd5c2ad8c56790b1bf9ec098a6304f6beb1929532f17f9fa032b7189bc1a042a86c1cc1293dc2472800c2bb5cbedde1f5c15169a6574fb40d30dd824d9dbfe2f1e4dbb169d6a0d7413aa4dac2d178779ff9c94a7ce5bfddf0e3b1d12fecc6c5529baabea3748de776fa2ebf7ec006c211db42f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_025\"></a></p>\n<p>1993年小升初暑假，我照例被寄存在奶奶家。某天，二手堂哥忽然来找我，要我去他家玩。<br>\n他说的“家”是我大娘自己原来的房子，离我大爷大娘那个万人大厂很近，离市区很远。<br>\n我犹豫了3秒就答应了。对我来说最大的吸引力在于，没大人管。二手堂哥那时不喜欢和我大爷住一起，准初二了而且是放假期间，吃饭只需要直接进厂去找我大娘。他是一个人住的。<br>\n此外他们家不光有厂内的闭路电视看，还承诺了要请我打电游。<br>\n他请我打的正是《忍者神龟3》。他们厂子那一带穷乡僻壤，电游厅（包机房）单价也便宜，1块钱40分钟。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/aacda77e136ef3ce25d2b68f94332318d78c64ee89b31004a012c65c48297c0cdabf5c2e614446848d667b23a0bac4aa28528bdb15c21c978e32a3d256bdac8e3c13387346a7cc077c8aa5f18266cdf4020951a03740514b128d89fe640ddb41a96dd81579fc43d037052e1d8ac8b75d73f8fddbbc5c7da0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_005\"></a></p>\n<p>防盗版机制令游戏难度直接变成HARD，敌人都变得皮糙血厚。他花第3块钱的时候我们才见到斯雷德。等我俩打了十几分钟斯雷德还打不死的时候，老板提示说时间要到了，并且友善提醒：这个斯雷德是打不死的，别白费力气了。<br>\n这时旁边有位观战的大哥忽然冒出一句：“只有打斯雷德之前一个馅饼（回血道具）都不吃才能把他打死。”<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/42e5a4552ac29473210adf843b2d83aba08c3320225ec3f61e5304ed7bb04c0759ef1628071bf2f7c74da3574b7fa80298aae1a51c5aab5f4da7714f3b7f3cc494f8f49870fd9b5bbf962686dccfd5db79629942645d3fdfa096d19894e66bdb4409dac9f9f3374d7e7bdb2e2cb7492fa71255cc9230ba21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_030\"></a></p>\n<p>第二天回家之后我妈因为我跟“外人”走了把我臭骂一顿。并且要求我找机会请二手堂哥玩点什么，不能占他便宜。<br>\n1993年的中秋节是9月30号。中秋节自己家聚会，第二天有远房亲戚来看望我奶奶。于是第二天的时候就拉他回请，继续玩《忍者神龟3》。<br>\n我奶奶家附近的包机房是正常的1块钱30分钟，但好运气，是30条命的hack版。这次花了4块钱。小心翼翼的不碰馅饼，结果涛声依旧。<br>\n不吃披萨也不能打死BOSS这件事让我直接龙场悟道：“爱科学，传谣不信谣。”<br>\n这也是为什么后来我在电游厅为什么能顺嘴说出“<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/8489e9fe3953997455bc152f315adb81f48a77524d5c58dcffdcfecda3f82995327d43d4a5bdad70d403c09d379abe454a446c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">黑暗海豹</a>”去忽悠别人。既然吃了亏，就要拉更多的人进坑。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/aceebf94d43e2e9d3efa7b4d8e842dfd2760bde9df27d1f7b0e3d6edd59f7ba53f639a19ff7e567597d39547bbf6605a6d9c6062b2783dfcedf155eea313e50c8d59ab9959e2ed5d7e5e91fc129ddd2129230d62ab9e93eba3704dbd433c533d9c4a6b1380687e6959707850adfb6b86ff96ca39ba5da3a9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_013\"></a></p>\n<p>要说当年就真的没有通关的方法了吗？倒也未必。除了有可能出现的正版卡以外，也有传闻，使用“魂斗罗30条命秘技”是可以选关的，把斯雷德跳过去不就行了。我和二手堂哥也都各自实验了一下，都没成功就放弃了。现在得知真相：《忍者神龟3代》美版选关秘技是<strong>↑↑↓↓←→←→AB</strong>，而我是熟练精准掌握魂斗罗秘技的，只按BA完事，二手堂哥是冗余派的BABA，我们都没按错，也不属于另外一个ABBA的错误派别，所以就一步之遥咯。<br>\n小马过河是世界上最好的寓言，只不过验证这件事，是要付出成本的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/0067a4e6b6a017eddca372b94de4718ea062dcb8e62edfa66b50a537f0edbda599e63766d4fd7e7f1c616a4c9b5e34611be1b4b8f16582944b0d994159d22e20eb1e3de7591a0b05dfe28958554b14c1abda0c20b5c2196f850506ad4ccbcae0f3427c86940843e9f9ca62af41022df44e61168e3b2b0b55\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_018\"></a></p>\n<p>说回游戏。本作日版发行于1991年，美版是1992年，FC发展到此时已经是大成阶段，所以这款游戏在画质音乐都非常优秀，游戏性和趣味性比前作更是强出一大截。最大的特色是设计了不同的“绝招”代替之前的“扇脸蛋子”。最好用的依旧是达芬奇，双刀可以封线且多打BOSS几次；其次是多纳泰罗（爱因斯坦），翻滚攻击多段输出；拉斐尔的绝招类似街霸里警察的“窜电”，出招快，连打带跑，安全性高；米开朗基罗的绝招最差，出招慢且主要对空，适用范围极逼仄。<br>\n发这种大招是要掉血的，不过扣到最后一滴血就不会再扣了。由此也诞生了动作游戏小白最普遍的玩法：只要不停放大招就好。这种玩法有两个缺点，一是被碰一下就挂了；另一个是，因为绝招并不是两个键无脑同时按下，而是要先点一下跳在几帧之内再按拳，所以非常累手。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/05713c72d469442747b16e635463d820968379311e119b359a9d38cbe2d69cec8134c3e1ca099a2d89c3ae08b1c2b967ac3c8b4971466c8b26034d64323ea35db0b3a06d9a4377e965b8ef720c6885c1dd837e2c183cf78c1cc37c6d001a4744a09420caa7f514ed1d593dec5c5fa1596f4400ebb79961cf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_007\"></a></p>\n<p>高端的玩家玩法要优雅很多，他们用的是另一个新出的招式“下挑”，一般的福特兵一下一个。这招也非常累手，这回累的是左手。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/e2229fe0a101e9593d21e60ba53cb268fc2796204995492942ea6c8b1d99e2fe0e5b4016d0cb6387d3bbac92f327ded298438dd83b69bed3893a158a5e73d25a62e3ed4e4feb288a7154f19e046ffd3dace63c28d412133c0d20bba788db69d60d70144fac8b7d8a2cef6917d1db2d75fc9a710bc60699b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_006\"></a></p>\n<p>科纳米这次把福特兵的种类设计得异常丰富，长枪、铁桶、鞭子、铁砧、回旋镖，甚至还有专门扬沙子的。尤其倒数第二关有个电梯场景，所有敌人拉出来遛一圈，挺带感的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/b6bd958983cae394fddcebb79e8e04d300bcda75a32ee62bc87080c28b668932e397d1b45d0a1903490eed6cc31a280fb7a7d79610fefc5d46313f75c3f460a2ebafe24fa71d3a013798e3141aed5905086e63f733021069daa57e1dc0f4f1b9c37ced8c50aa9f1600de9bcb9cc6cd0dbb363194dd2d7cfb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_032\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/724c2aeaee940da4277b86b1848721d6d58c786f8f73a843db5680b68a7c645b65d871ccc199719208e32346c9c8676405dcb8dcf60db3e2cc25cd44c29f4b68faecf696621c227c669453f84adb715ec024f3b5d5bfea8927b48338558fb68a3899567584f148b48c048f11f4f26470ff02a4231bba2b7f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_023\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/8bbc9945a6dd2fa4f63044c29029525770b29c79ce025777b192e7c2ad05fc800b6396f9c78deb5c7a596f7dc2c2ecbe77b527c8bec8ee4742f176a1bb36dc8b064c367ae41a289bd1f89121df4c1256a3fda18956ad19ac561d966d1db499f7c22bb985d3c75e153cd5a6c90456b6589afa4dfca62d3276\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_020\"></a></p>\n<p>与之对应的，乌龟的受伤方式也很丰富，被压扁被束缚被电击，统计这玩意儿多少有点受虐狂了。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/62364259f490a307449f2a65586b10b7572851db276348a98db8f14ba9ee177e485e8474b79f89114e352f716b34593adcd1a305edfaee94156bd9eb96ffd665697e30851bf1ec95917264bcc11df7c364692ad8b2bcac9bfacaf27cf596e88726644702a4599adef9e69cab8d016e07a4959eabfd6f011d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_010\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/a76ecaa836767fcfd90c591aef2a6d03dc473795424c23f510dc0407f106409068a668609a729497b238f27bd4ac29ab7b3f9a5fc18b70e8a925b76c99ef343755d15a1e6f719853531171666d950511969ecfe8c5252940d1f410f983d9f7bf379d7777fc7c0eaae3e9a4b300fcbd7cabb30ecfffd2faaf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_031\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/d4928debc2b5bb47c8d08e94378bd2dbb8e4a35d6d6c16af8dfbfc574e87bae23b97379f70f8bb6eb87a9bba86de6cdaaba9d540b19a5303e9741f4aa996b7bcd6e27d47cd610d88cb8b94d568490eae1fcc3fa5f26e2d5827ef4ae8de75346352218c67eb143f6af4545d308931576a6d5c7cb57dca5468\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_033\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/f53fb53160006f440e85ce7daddb95bc917b473115af30fb79571aca80dead04d9b417116f7fb76c1803a0331fdaad7317b25e0e55ac13a014daf289166c6864cb59a172587731df3aea22e9fe65ef5ef1337567a93d615d1431afe22d8d40c154deedfa0e1374f330ba22f2ac7d42ba8d7f753da1c64798\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_019\"></a></p>\n<p>故事方面好像是原创的，但也有说法是基于一个动画版改的，不管怎样都平平无奇。反正爱普莉儿又双叒叕被斯雷德抓走了。这次斯雷德和朗格玩了个大的，把整个曼哈顿搞成了个空岛，有种X-MEN电影的既视感。这也是副标题《曼哈顿计划》的由来。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/634d3901477fcf775f8952ef5191fe040847b702db8bdb6ebb73c9bb27faa2562f3ec9c7fe691b8ba7d4760e0d59c94f2ac4be6bf567e05828a3db3b9e090f4f0af828c94e8b2f9cbf7a5dbf7e556ce721773bf778950d4bfefa7c1693dc935ab6798307ef640fcf26ec20babff0648a312c199247ed3a02\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_002\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/53df1fb2ad3eb7f55a88fda7f689cb286d428f69ca8d4ed5c99c00bbdc02b8eb70bb3527a64d96925f50273ce707ba00954735c9296f5ca2c05d72b640df1972e8a0f381d40d3e27a14d37d75bb1fc4ac9e43f21812b578184fedc060d3529bb7c06e18575cc046efbe63a258003f1e2e08cd4266e4a2bad\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_001\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/310317e07e4a742add65db96c11706f73dd9cdcc99942a8ea110360776c69111a78cd12e46e54c9a11d3bcdb5784a6b45e8bd08201f1ffe8ed3c52f7c7b22c3dcd3b61a80f9e9aa241a1c3e1ca01e15983ba0cf300cec60a03a2206c749b1bdd30f472f296d6a961c5980ac850b01c9c84bf738284f84645\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_040\"></a></p>\n<p>前面几关BOSS除了牛头猪面这俩熟人，还有很多机械怪和变异怪，不少关卡还设置了些不咬人膈应人的中BOSS，不求要命命但求费血那种。其中见到斯雷德之前最难的是第五关的鳄鱼，甩尾巴那一下又快又狠。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/b44085e9d885d22a163d9031dd94431b82805557152ff790472299e1d9de3af439dd1c0b9c169f4b520f7fa6d78fa5882377fe54bb5d4de5570421a085e91b25920c55f495471d6f4bd055cec22ce0dfe27fec0fb20bdad1f853592d453a18c29c608c277707f5e51a62a160d1d8f2a395321b244af9f553\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_004\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/bfa86da7c58b4169a7a162826b333aa584309d47a211bf83a6de9d7a9ecad1befec8621dc5797a1e8bccacb48abc6f44fba909d8abeaa98f4b23a96126de5566c8a6841c2ad853fb52e544cf825640ea91e80d7a85d1f13ad322c9223144b91b6981b05bb0abc08e1ffab4798698d537443b510a237947ac\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_008\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/ecebcea7202e1f7ed332ffb85eb5a18b46dabfa747571014f427c6e5af706f47ccb668c2e3e2006a42ca75cebbb427710f2c0c28fd4f9943c6017ce6aec1513a4cb5fb0736d4269ae05d8debbed6d00db9a129f401f620dd9f5292ce809b4d605b9ff9c4419b0973f7a1b5dbc7da67c7de82ee0d8c786d9f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_012\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/03df907c92c934e0dfbaa04e261b48b3afccb2432db1e323cc5d19d373ec5b71fec661c43accaa009847bc2c29a215b3f369d6723a724185f55d158379fb0c418e3e99f36e2f89026696cb104a07d1c6814416f4abd10df60ecad038e6d8aaba5ab79e8847da2d950075d6a6289118698ddb31f5dabe159e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_015\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/0f610cf4d7dd2c7f9fe83956863c47798a099cabf11781e09bb35bf7efd006921b4171618fbb1b73e452a35d5446b126b210c4173c6b1d30e3466b40738bc427e93ee47fb57bc57beaf8c15e925f502819a92d55e6673daa4b23a1a5cef29c6730e2e943812515fbba780a17a1fcac1e94ab1a8e76293d02\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_021\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/0dc35793b7ad765ed555673db50392a10904734e26f7799da2c402539baf4314c3527d484a7e8e911c8f2f18be83d1221d1e31352e57e3c1baab1eb2744256f5aa27bbe666fa405f16373098b492a7f20c9c2a4c726beffd42d027\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_024\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/937e8d16c4f697077f82f9eda5731414c8aeb20adfec305e8d298609788c3b7157a77d60cabd21b0d36d36a0730989b15b0c31dd24a43308c52437e3fb550ff4d0ddadbf08e66c40a0524ae75863f8e36263e5713ee942b96180bf9faddfd61e634d8a02dd333f82b84a3bb66e886b8165ec09ba1fd7b43d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_026\"></a></p>\n<p>下面就是打不死的斯雷德了。其实正常打不怎么难，压迫感甚至还没有上一代强。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/5854c526671adf82e01063dc01aaa372f712526a0abd2e413ffaecf22d1bb48bfb4b2e742db62485c1dda8fda04ed387955d75d2c4ac70285e1911826094434dcf91202f97bc70fea9eb22d083a4cd966a285d09ce7c249f40c75fc0109b2b30da881ea423cbfdf81866dd916018066297dbac000e40baa7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_027\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/4d0e34ba5868c2cb39f3f19279c045aed77a46ee9981f774966ab2e5e2a82d65e1bb959070779e9b8ae81f2f1220124f8e7388e71dfe1f5a8d28cf41634b8123c96bc5ab48fa80bb0b1234f2fc930011b072bd02de992c68ed7f080051dbe2df3a615a2d0e84fde8f4e6d3487c565725fe0d2cfa86ffbf04\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_028\"></a></p>\n<p>打完斯雷德之后还有还有两关，守关的是朗格和变异斯雷德。难倒是没多难，只是流程相当的长，打到这会儿注意力都下降了，手更是要搓出腱鞘炎了。以我这臭手当年5块钱都不一定能兜住底。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/310c165317c6fa0a73aa1c64de4d6b72879ede3b88b0abfa8c368b8b6e861b44d0120ad9f12a53086967415d38ceba2dd6670f3bf958ffbd0d712e52302aaa91e94eb85c8965b36379049b36c9b92e249a370906d0c4e9f7b5ffa5bbedfbfb569a9e69e957ea86eda2cfec326d1c639bfa9ffc3189c25279\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_029\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/53d9424f5ac31701462c8195f2d95e2345967f7ceb254c285b255be0e8a179baad459a17cb8d3b9f2a5cf1db3e5f8c88009b7f1abb558409170ca9d36cb8f99fea10b2a8213028fdcedcc8835e9eb883d6f19341e59aaf3a8ed5c7f0d028e63d7f8fcf5cfed1d879b45ebdb5a5244c6240e2098d90e998a6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_034\"></a></p>\n<p>守关的斯雷德，形象莫名有点像《幽游白书》里的武威，技能是操控雷电，不过他放雷电大招的时候也是破绽最大的时候，抓机会一顿猛放大招就行。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/d3a56262ab5756052714bb7ad9910d91dcef5bfcc3cd06053b9daef2901e523cd062e10b543bed1690f95977a43e4972b3e17c8608cdb0545ff5cc27f8f35c535c39b33db0fa216d8b9e46aa17f9a97adf6776904680d714740005a7d29e21673d49c80de4f652788c562cff6ac2630017afb26618adbe88\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_037\"></a></p>\n<p>通关！<br>\n怨念退散！<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/4ef5f1dd67a20d8a6bb91d67b721e4839108fd88384fa3508c2edac8d4ba0e1eed5b1403b2f3bafd5e74ea64e778810938271df4285605a4ddde9bd7243dad193414f74ca5d2c1a14f21b7f06e95cc5d68265f4efdfa22e0e07c6275df70b1a5b5251dd5c70faeacbb7524d7e136c10350aca36486dab916\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_038\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">(1)</a>：别问为啥用千问，问就是88VIP快到期了，不愿意多注册国产服务。</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div><span>《<a href=\"https://pewae.com/2026/10/teenage-mutant-ninja-turtles-iii-the-manhattan-project.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">忍者神龟3</a>》采用<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">署名-非商业性使用-禁止演绎</a>许可协议进行许可。 『<a href=\"https://pewae.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">破袜子</a>』期待与您交流。</span><div><div><h3>相关推荐:</h3><ul><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2024/09/mega-man-3.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">洛克人3</a><span>[47%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2009/05/e7bb9d-e68b9b.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">绝招</a><span>[43%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2006/07/teenage-mutant-ninja-turtles.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">激龟忍者传</a><span>[42%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2007/07/altered-beast.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">兽王记</a><span>[34%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2015/12/night-night.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">天天天黑</a><span>[33%]</span></li></ul></div></div></div>",
